    description:
      'Toyota is recalling 121,260 bZ3X and bZ7 EVs in China over suspension, braking and steering defects, plus 55,477 Land Cruiser Prado and Lexus GX hybrids over a fuel-line fault.',
    date: 'November 5, 2026',
    dateISO: '2026-11-05',
